# belt/sheaths/sword_hilt: A3's sheathed hilt at the hip in side views (brass guard and pommel, the leather grip)
# The slice (P2b wave 1, FOLK-BODY); A3's pixels are the reference (docs/ref/style_a3). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
body adult
role sheath sword
layer belt
anchor hip
keys hilt
z 1

view R key idle origin -4 5
|....v.
|...vPv
|..vhv.
|hPfv..
|NOv...

view R key rest origin -4 5
|....v.
|...vPv
|..vhv.
|.Pfv..
|NOv...

view L key rest origin 10 1
|.v....P..
|vP....O..
|.v...hNgh

# facing down and up the sheathed hilt is the scabbard's own (belt/sheaths/sword rest): empty views, so every clip that
# leaves the hilt channel at rest finds one (P2b production, FOLK-BODY)
view D key rest origin 0 0
|.

view U key rest origin 0 0
|.
